# To add a real notification sound:
# 1. Find a suitable notification sound (short, pleasant, not too loud)
# 2. Convert it to MP3 format if needed
# 3. Replace this placeholder file with the actual audio file
# 4. Ensure the file size is reasonable (under 100KB recommended)

# Common sources for notification sounds:
# - Freesound.org (free sounds with proper licensing)
