# - Custom recordings

# Recommended characteristics:
# - Duration: 0.5-2 seconds
# - Format: MP3, 44.1kHz, 128kbps
# - Volume: Moderate (not too loud or jarring)
# - Tone: Professional, pleasant, attention-getting but not annoying
